31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have information. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka, that's a lie! I'm just a villager! Why would you target me so early?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Eh?! May-san is the wolf? That's a huge surprise!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Asuka is claiming to be the Seer. If she's telling the truth, the game ends today.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim. Asuka, are you certain, or are you the werewolf trying to frame May?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
