37,1,2,talk,May,,"This is ridiculous! I'm being framed! @Minako, @Shion, you can't possibly believe her without proof!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Asuka-san seems so sure... maybe May-san is just a really good actor?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"If Asuka is the werewolf, she's taking a huge risk by claiming Seer on day one.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"True. Usually, the werewolf stays quiet. Asuka's logic is consistent with a Seer's move.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I have no reason to lie. Voting May is the most logical choice for the village.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm a human! Please, don't listen to her! Rin, you know me, right?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I do, but that's why it's so confusing! I'll trust the Seer for now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. The risk of executing a villager is lower than the risk of letting a known werewolf live.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll follow the evidence. May, your desperation is starting to look suspicious.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
